[node name="CrawlText" type="Label3D" parent="CrawlLayer/SubViewport" unique_id=592285922]
unique_name_in_owner = true
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 0.469472, 0.882948, 0, -0.882948, 0.469472, 0, -1.8, 0.8)
modulate = Color(0.97, 0.79, 0.31, 1)
outline_modulate = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.9)
text = "OUTER REACH // CYCLE 4097

The last human convoy has entered an uncharted asteroid storm. Mission Control calls the situation ‘fluid’, chiefly because ‘doomed’ is bad for morale.

The pilot cannot see far enough to navigate at speed. Two navigation intelligences, ALPHA and BETA, offer a way through. One intends to save the ship, the other intends to save time. Both consider the distinction rather petty.

Their loyalties may change so be careful to read the routes and choose whom to trust. Take control when trust becomes educational.

Do try to keep the ship intact... the paperwork is formidable."
outline_size = 8
vertical_alignment = 0
line_spacing = 14.0
autowrap_mode = 2
autowrap_trim_flags = 64
width = 600.0

